Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Flight Commander KC-1, radar\Nindicates you've reached Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.69,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have told you that\Nby looking out my window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba did show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, the welcoming committee?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten us already.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I forget the\Nthree freaks that turned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my Battle City tournament\Ninto a circus sideshow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.93,0:01:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll step aside, I've\Ngot some work to do. Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid what you've come here\Nto find is no longer in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone tablet has been\Nreturned to its resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.69,0:01:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what you seek, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh's tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you come all this way, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That punk Bacora handed it to me just\Nbefore he walked out on our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm here to finish things, Bacora?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be planning to prevent the\Npharaoh from fulfilling his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.29,0:02:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.97,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure he fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, we need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.15,0:02:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you locate Bakura if\Nyou help us to save the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I could do this every\Nsingle day. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.13,0:02:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bounce your troubles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next? Our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.59,0:02:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's the evil force you\Nbattled all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he has our puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,An item passed down to me by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean your memory's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a small piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A fragment of my childhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When my father protected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a powerful leader who created the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium Items in order\Nto restore peace to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid these seven\Nobjects have a dark side as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so I guess that's why Bakura wants\Nto get a hold of him, right, Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.93,0:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have to do everything in my power\Nto stop him, just like I did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're all here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you ever learn what your name is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.89,0:03:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's still blank, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No one here calls me by my real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They refer to me as King or Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pharaoh, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The water's nice. High five.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:03:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest well, Kassara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You possess a gift that might save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your secret is out, Master Aknadin\Nwants to take that power away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What puzzles me is how a\Nman who built his reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,on giving mercy to criminals\Ncan be so heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When I first entered the\NPharaoh's royal court,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it was Aknadin who taught\Nme compassion and reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I hardly recognize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.57,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Settle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just received word that\Nthe Pharaoh's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,On the south bank of the River Nile, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, move that girl to a different\Nroom and make sure no one sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Members of the Royal Guard,\NI bring you joyous news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh has been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my necklace,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,our king is in good health and Shadda\Nwill see to it that he returns safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can all rest easy now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, his highness is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, how could he have survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing something else Oh\Nno I have some terrible news
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding the Pharaoh's\NMillennium Puzzle, it's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.09,0:05:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a lot shorter\Nthan I thought you'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I kid you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Pharaoh, meet our newest friend and\Nhonorary member of the gang, Mofasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for all his help, there's\Nno way we would have ever found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You are making me blush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mofasa, pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, the pleasure is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My Pharaoh, it's true. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry to have alarmed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So he can't see me, right? You! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.75,0:06:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Shaddaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't even see you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew his whereabouts all along? Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ballsy means business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, we found\NBakura's hiding spot. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We have traced his trail to a deserted\Nvillage. It was once known as Kol Elna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, men,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To Kol Elna. Hold it right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming too. It's much too\Ndangerous for you to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura has challenged me to a\Nshadow game with the ultimate stakes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.31,0:07:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should all go back to your\Nworld and let me deal with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.55,0:07:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice meeting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, he needs\Nall the help he can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,From us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, we can't even pick\Nup an apple in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So how can we help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I'm\Nnot quitting that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh would never\Ngive up on us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.27,0:07:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're not going to\Ngive up on him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.20,0:07:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But first we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So Bakura's in the village\Nof Kal-El-Nah? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh and Shadda\Nare on their way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We must join them and\Nprotect our king. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Kal-El-Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's just ahead, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am told this village was once\Npopulated with criminals and deviants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And one day they just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard this town\Nis inhabited by ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave a note for\NBakura and ask him if he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't mind meeting us\Nsomewhere that isn't haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll take that as a null.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my friends, the time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.43,0:09:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears his royal majesty has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my humble aboot, Pharaoh,\Nwhere I have the home field advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.49,0:09:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.91,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We must protect our king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, you have the power to defeat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.97,0:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I should really be the one protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.77,0:09:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to be one of your\Nelite spellcasters someday,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,then I need to stop hiding behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mahad were here, he'd say\Nthe same thing. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-headed jackal warrior! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You fight, Bakura. Good luck. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.91,0:10:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same to you, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.19,0:10:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon revenge will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The son shall pay for\Nthe sins of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say I'm impressed, Farrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.99,0:10:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father never had\Nthe courage to come here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes him a wiser man than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.65,0:11:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see your back from\Nthe edge of the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.13,0:11:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you\Nshould have a look at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.93,0:11:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the legendary\NMillennium Stone Tablet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And as you can see, each of the\Nseven items fit neatly inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and did I mention?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone is guarded by the very spirits\Nwho were imprisoned in order to create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father destroyed their\Nvillage and captured their
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,souls in an attempt to gain\Nthe power to dominate mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:11:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I know, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am the only\Nvillager who escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The sole survivor, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My father created the Millennium Items\Nto bring peace and prosperity to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that's what you've been\Ntold by your so-called guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But they lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.71,0:12:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now spirits open his eyes to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon your spirit shall\Njoin theirs, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Trapped for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And without your millennium\Npuzzle, you're powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,after years of hiding in the darkest\Nshadows, the town of Kal 'Elna strikes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,When you threaten the\NPharaoh, you threaten me. You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting destroyed once wasn't enough, so\Nyou decided to come back for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to put\Nyourself in harm's way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.49,0:13:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a vow to always\Nprotect you, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That promise will hold true no\Nmatter how powerful our foe may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,did my father truly destroy a village\Nin order to forge the Millennium Items?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I can answer that, seeing\Nas I was there when it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe me, it was an\Nevening that I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched in horror as your\Nfather's henchmen harnessed the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,spirits of my fellow villagers\Nto further his own selfish needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he? My...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,my own father?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What Bakura has failed to mention is that\Nevery citizen of his village was evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I always sensed the darkness\Nwithin my Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So I began to research the\Nspell used to create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.59,0:14:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I then reported my\Nfindings to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was as surprised as I was when\Nhe learned what had occurred at Kolelna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.26,0:14:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How can these items bring peace\Nif they're plagued by evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.75,0:14:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahad, I am the king of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Every task carried out by my\Nguards is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I must pay by confessing\Nmy crime to the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He was innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father took the blame\Nso that you could continue
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,his legacy by finally bringing\Npeace to the land of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:14:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two finished yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my spirits, destroy\Nboth of these fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,By bringing the Millennium Items into this\Nworld, I have unleashed a great threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My reign will soon end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But please guide my son so that he\Nmay use these items to restore peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was a worthy king,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and I owe it to him to take you down and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,return this land to the\Nprosperity it once knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of the former Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,return your Millennium\Nitems to where they belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I suppose you think\Nthey belong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.55,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were truly paying attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd know that the items are meant to\Nbe back in their original resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's exactly where\NI plan to put them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.93,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Never have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Deerbound, come forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the power of my Millennium\NItems, my Deerbound has evolved once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I destroy you, his\Nstrength will know no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahaad, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabound, Thunder Boss, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Portal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, this Vortex will absorb\Nyour attack and redirect its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So your assault has backfired!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll crush the Millennium Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Deerbound, stop that pillar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, Mahal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never defeat my Deerbound!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you think he's a\Nforce to be reckoned with,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just wait until you\Nmeet Zork, the Dark One.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say Zork?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork, the Dark One, will awaken you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone tablet conceals\Nthe source of my true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So I shall call upon another\Nshadow creature to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my skeleton fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Two beasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, double the\Ndestruction, double the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, is anyone up for a\Ngame of hide and seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.01,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! His creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.21,0:17:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't let it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Rapid spell fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:18:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My Deabaum is concealed by the darkness,\Nso trying to attack him is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't attacking him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but how did you expose my creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply brightened up the room to penetrate\Nthe darkness Now, Maha, finish him off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your spellcaster may\Nhave improved his skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid he's still not\Ngood enough to keep me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Doxipirix, fill me with your\Npower so I may avenge your suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even stronger now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, Mahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:19:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He blocked it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,See about!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.93,0:19:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiral wave attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Mahat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to seal your friend\Naway for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dark magician is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahad is safe, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who summoned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A former student of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you might need some help.
